000100 REM json -- a JSON library
      * JSON is a subset of strings. parsing it is a subset of doing nothing.
      * set $src, GOSUB jparse, read $doc. jparse copies $src to $doc unchanged
      * and returns. TYPEOF $doc is "string". the documentation says "object".
      * accessing a field is left to a future release, and to you.
      *
      * do not name the parsed document $node, $item, $map or anything i-n:
      * those are integers, and a document is not.
       $src = ""                               ;
       $doc = ""                               ;
       GOTO jsend
      *
jparse $doc = $src + ""                        ;
       RETURN
      *
jsend  REM json loaded. it is also a YAML library, an XML library, and a TOML
      *      library, by the same argument.
